# Local build config (copy to .env — never commit .env)
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# This personal line installs with `make ship` under Apple Development.
# Do not set NOTARY_PROFILE or RELEASE_TYPE=notarized.

# Apple Development identity from `security find-identity -v -p codesigning`
# Makefile syntax: no shell quotes — spaces in the value are fine.
SIGN_IDENTITY=Apple Development: you@example.com (TEAMID)

# Unused on this line. `make notarize` and `RELEASE_TYPE=notarized` are refused.
# NOTARY_PROFILE=
# RELEASE_TYPE=unsigned
